<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview boosts TCSI.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview boosts TCSI.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview analyst Kevin Slocum said he upgraded his rating on TCSI Corp to buy from hold, but left his short-term rating unchanged at hold.</p>
<p>-- The analyst said his earnings estimate for TCSI, which was formerly known as Teknekron Communications Systems, stand at $0.01 per share for fiscal 1997 and $0.30 per share in fiscal 1998.</p>
</text>
